\s1 Amaziah Reigns in Judah
\r \ref 2 Chronicles 25:1–4|2CH 25:1-4\ref*)
\p \v 1 \rb In the second|שְׁתַּ֔יִם\rb* \rb year|בִּשְׁנַ֣ת\rb* \rb of the reign|מֶ֣לֶךְ\rb* \rb of Jehoash|לְיוֹאָ֥שׁ\rb*\f + \fr 14:1 \ft Hebrew \fqa Joash\ft , a variant of \fqa Jehoash\ft ; also in verses 13, 23, and 27\f* \rb son|בֶּן־\rb* \rb of Jehoahaz|יוֹאָחָ֖ז\rb* \rb over Israel,|יִשְׂרָאֵ֑ל\rb* \rb Amaziah|אֲמַצְיָ֥הוּ\rb* \rb son|בֶן־\rb* \rb of Joash|יוֹאָ֖שׁ\rb* \rb became king|מָלַ֛ךְ\rb*\rb |מֶ֥לֶךְ\rb* \rb of Judah.|יְהוּדָֽה׃\rb* \v 2 \rb He was|הָיָ֣ה\rb* \rb twenty-five|עֶשְׂרִ֨ים\rb*\rb |וְחָמֵ֤שׁ\rb* \rb years old|בֶּן־\rb*\rb |שָׁנָה֙\rb* \rb when he became king,|בְמָלְכ֔וֹ\rb* \rb and he reigned|מָלַ֖ךְ\rb* \rb in Jerusalem|בִּירוּשָׁלִָ֑ם\rb* \rb twenty-nine|וְעֶשְׂרִ֤ים\rb*\rb |וָתֵ֙שַׁע֙\rb* \rb years.|שָׁנָ֔ה\rb* \rb His mother’s|אִמּ֔וֹ\rb* \rb name|וְשֵׁ֣ם\rb* \rb was Jehoaddan;|יְהוֹעַדִּין\rb* \rb she was from|מִן־\rb* \rb Jerusalem.|יְרוּשָׁלִָֽם׃\rb* \v 3 \rb And he did|וַיַּ֤עַשׂ\rb* \rb what was right|הַיָּשָׁר֙\rb* \rb in the eyes|בְּעֵינֵ֣י\rb* \rb of the LORD,|יְהוָ֔ה\rb* \rb but|רַ֕ק\rb* \rb not|לֹ֖א\rb* \rb as his father|אָבִ֑יו\rb* \rb David had done.|כְּדָוִ֣ד\rb* \rb He did|עָשָׂ֛ה\rb* \rb everything|כְּכֹ֧ל\rb* \rb as|אֲשֶׁר־\rb* \rb his father|אָבִ֖יו\rb* \rb Joash|יוֹאָ֥שׁ\rb* \rb had done.|עָשָֽׂה׃\rb*
\p \v 4 \rb Nevertheless,|רַ֥ק\rb* \rb the high places|הַבָּמ֖וֹת\rb* \rb were not|לֹא־\rb* \rb taken away,|סָ֑רוּ\rb* \rb and the people|הָעָ֛ם\rb* \rb continued|ע֥וֹד\rb* \rb sacrificing|מְזַבְּחִ֥ים\rb* \rb and burning incense|וּֽמְקַטְּרִ֖ים\rb* \rb on the high places.|בַּבָּמֽוֹת׃\rb*
\p \v 5 \rb |וַיְהִ֕י\rb* \rb As soon as|כַּאֲשֶׁ֛ר\rb* \rb the kingdom|הַמַּמְלָכָ֖ה\rb* \rb was firmly|חָזְקָ֥ה\rb* \rb in his grasp,|בְּיָד֑וֹ\rb* \rb Amaziah executed|וַיַּךְ֙\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb the servants|עֲבָדָ֔יו\rb* \rb who had murdered|הַמַּכִּ֖ים\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb his father|אָבִֽיו׃\rb* \rb the king.|הַמֶּ֥לֶךְ\rb* \v 6 \rb Yet|וְאֶת־\rb* \rb he did not|לֹ֣א\rb* \rb put the sons|בְּנֵ֥י\rb* \rb of the murderers|הַמַּכִּ֖ים\rb* \rb to death,|הֵמִ֑ית\rb* \rb but acted according to what is written|כַּכָּת֣וּב\rb* \rb in the Book|בְּסֵ֣פֶר\rb* \rb of the Law|תּֽוֹרַת־\rb* \rb of Moses,|מֹ֠שֶׁה\rb* \rb where|אֲשֶׁר־\rb* \rb the LORD|יְהוָ֜ה\rb*\rb |לֵאמֹ֗ר\rb* \rb commanded:|צִוָּ֨ה\rb* \rb “Fathers|אָב֤וֹת\rb* \rb must not|לֹא־\rb* \rb be put to death|יוּמְת֨וּ\rb* \rb for|עַל־\rb* \rb their children,|בָּנִים֙\rb* \rb and children|וּבָנִים֙\rb* \rb must not|לֹא־\rb* \rb be put to death|יוּמְת֣וּ\rb* \rb for|עַל־\rb* \rb their fathers;|אָב֔וֹת\rb* \rb each|אִ֥ישׁ\rb* \rb is to die|יָמוּת׃\rb* \rb for his own sin.”|בְּחֶטְא֖וֹ\rb*\f + \fr 14:6 \ft \ref Deuteronomy 24:16|DEU 24:16\ref*\f*
